@StoreApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000

### Public product catalog
GET {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Public category catalog
GET {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Register a customer (save the returned token for authenticated requests)
POST {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Example Customer",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeThis!12345"
}

### Log in
POST {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeThis!12345"
}

### Create an order (replace the token and product ID)
POST {{StoreApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "1 Example Street, Cape Town",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
